WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,000
Chen Haoyun, son of Lao Xu, brought me a book

2
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,120
Thank you all

3
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,420
I have been tired of writing all my life

4
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,660
Get a toast from your enemy

5
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,740
Died strangely

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,580
But this glass of wine is for Fenggu

7
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:29,420
Don't owe him your life easily

8
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,860
After this battle

9
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:33,740
I use your blood

10
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:41,980
Remember his old man's glass of wine, his second glass of wine, this glass of wine

11
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,820
Evil ghost's elegant reply

12
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,380
Jing Tianqing

13
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,100
Tian Qing has a grudge against me

14
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,740
I wish I could take revenge with my own hands
